        "created_at": "2023-11-12T18:55:35.902Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, I thought Adam typically grabbed three random names from his cover livestream to appear on the cover… but this one has Badell, Rebottaro, Bender. Is this the first time post-DE that the real trio got credits on a cover? I wonder why this one.</p>",
