        "created_at": "2023-11-12T19:14:02.559Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It’s not the first time.  There have been others like a lot of the Volume 2 Disparation issues they’ve done episodes done, Alpha Vol 3 Issue 12, and plenty of others.  I don’t know offhand what makes Adam choose their names.</p>",
