        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/walkingtarget/{size}/4833_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-11-13T00:20:33.076Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only names that are definitely canonical are ones he’s done for DE or the RPG (or the History, but we haven’t seen many covers from that yet). <em>Some</em> of the Writers’ Room covers may be accurate as well, but not guaranteed.</p>",
