      {
        "id": 255287,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-11-13T19:35:05.354Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t think any of them are random. They’ve codified a whole list in the History of Sentinel Comics book. There are several appearances by people who backed old projects at high levels, to get their names added to canon. I think C&amp;A have some friends in there, too. Obviously I don’t know many of them, but longtime Letters Page listeners will be able to pick some out.</p>",
