        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-11-14T13:07:47.804Z",
        "cooked": "<p>On the art stream the other day, Adam basically said that once the History is finished and they have writers assigned to everything they need to go back and correct the existing Writers’ Room covers. He didn’t outright say thus how he assigns credits for now, but I get the feeling it’s “whatever he feels like at the moment”.</p>",
