        "id": 265057,
        "name": "",
        "username": "LonelyMan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2026-02-07T01:09:09.194Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I wonder if Adam still wants that in-character vampire podcast.  I’d do it, if I knew he’d listen!</p>\n<p>I like how Guise’s defcon system upgrades from “weird”, which barely even registers, to “odd” when he still isn’t taking it seriously.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\" data-post=\"11\" data-topic=\"30310\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>And as for the wacky naming, my take has always been that the wacky naming is best when they come up with actual wacky alt-names like Toditos or Pouch Beasts, and the shm-thing has overstayed its welcome.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>+1000%</p>",
